    "body": "In case anyone wants to try this locally,\r\n\r\n1. Run `starship init zsh --print-full-init > ${HOME}/.starship-init.sh` to generate the final init script.\r\n1. Replace the current source cmd in `zshrc` (`eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"`) with (`source ${HOME}/.starship-init.sh;`)",
